span style=\"color:#3366cc\">DURATION</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:535px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366cc\">ELIGIBILITY</span></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:190px; width:168px\"><strong>MCA</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>60</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:108px\"><strong>&nbsp;2 Years</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align:justify; width:535px\">\r\n			<p><strong>Passed any graduation degree (e.g.: B.E./B.Tech./B.Sc./B.Com./B.A./B.Voc./BCA etc.) preferably with Mathematics at 10+2 level or at Graduation level obtained at least 50% marks (45% marks in case of candidates belonging to reserved category) in the qualifying examination.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><strong>Remark: For students having no mathematics background, BRIDGE COURSE is compulsory at Bhabha University.</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:20px\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"height:61px; width:1024px\">\r\n			<h3><strong>COLLEGE - RKDF COLLEGE OF ENGINEERING, BHOPAL</strong></h3>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px; width:168px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366cc\">COURSE</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366cc\">SEATS</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:108px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366cc\">DURATION</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:535px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366cc\">ELIGIBILITY</span></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:190px; width:168px\"><strong>MCA</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>60</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:108px\"><strong>&nbsp;2 Years</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align:justify; width:535px\">\r\n			<p><strong>Passed any graduation degree (e.g.: B.E./B.Tech./B.Sc./B.Com./B.A./B.Voc./BCA etc.) preferably with Mathematics at 10+2 level or at Graduation level obtained at least 50% marks (45% marks in case of candidates belonging to reserved category) in the qualifying examination.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><strong>Remark: For students having no mathematics background, BRIDGE COURSE is compulsory at Bhabha University.</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n',1),(3,3,'B.Tech',1,'<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"height:61px; width:1139px\">\r\n			<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">COLLEGE - BHABHA ENGINEERING RESEARCH INSTITUTE, BHOPAL</span></span></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px; width:81px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">COURSE</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:344px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">BRANCH</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">SEATS</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:108px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">DURATION</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:535px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">ELIGIBILITY</span></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"7\" style=\"height:100px; width:81px\"><strong>B.TECH</strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>MECHANICAL ENGINEERING</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>120</strong></td>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"7\" style=\"width:108px\"><strong>&nbsp;4 Years</strong></td>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"7\" style=\"width:535px\">\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Candidate must have passed the 10+2 Examination Physics and Mathematics as compulsory&nbsp; subjects along with one of the Chemistry / Biotechnology /Biology/ Technical Vocational Subject.Obtained at least 45% marks.Candidate belonging to SC, ST, OBC category of Madhya Pradesh with&nbsp; at least 40% marks in aggregate.&nbsp;<br />\r\n			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; OR&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Passed Diploma (in Engineering and Technology)examination with at least 45% marks (40% marksin case of candidates belonging to reserved category) subject to vacancies in the First Year, in case the vacancies at lateral entry are exhausted.</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px\"><strong>COMPUTER SCIENCE ENGINEERING</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>120</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px\"><strong>ELECTRONICS AND COMMUNICATION ENGG.</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>120</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:46px\"><strong>ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>60</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px\"><strong>CIVIL ENGINEERING</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>60</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px\"><strong>ELECTRICAL AND ELECTRONICS ENGG.</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>60</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px\"><strong>INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>60</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"height:61px; width:1139px\">\r\n			<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">COLLEGE - RKDF COLLEGE OF ENGINEERING, BHOPAL</span></span></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px; width:81px\"><span style=\"color:#3366ff\"><strong>COURSE</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:344px\"><span style=\"color:#3366ff\"><strong>BRANCH</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><span style=\"color:#3366ff\"><strong>SEATS</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:108px\"><span style=\"color:#3366ff\"><strong>DURATION</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:535px\"><span style=\"color:#3366ff\"><strong>ELIGIBILITY</strong></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"6\" style=\"height:240px; width:81px\"><strong>B.TECH</strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>MECHANICAL ENGINEERING</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>180</strong></td>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"6\" style=\"width:108px\"><strong>&nbsp;4 Years</strong></td>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"6\" style=\"width:535px\">\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Candidate must have passed the 10+2 Examination Physics and Mathematics as compulsory&nbsp; subjects along with one of the Chemistry / Biotechnology /Biology/ Technical Vocational Subject.Obtained at least 45% marks.Candidate belonging to SC, ST, OBC category of Madhya Pradesh with&nbsp; at least 40% marks in aggregate.&nbsp;<br />\r\n			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; OR&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Passed Diploma (in Engineering and Technology)examination with at least 45% marks (40% marksin case of candidates belonging to reserved category) subject to vacancies in the First Year, in case the vacancies at