INSERT INTO `department` VALUES (1,'ENGINEERING','BHABHA UNIVERISY','icon-statistics','<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Faculty of Engineering</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>The Faculty of Engineering at the Bhabha University Bhopal welcomes creative young people who can face the challenge of invigorating future society by achieving what has heretofore been impossible. We expect that these people will profoundly develop their abilities within the Faculty&rsquo;s environment, which we are confident in believing and saying is among the best in the north and east India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>To create groundbreaking inventions and to achieve what has been impossible so far with the application of existing techniques, students should not be content to simply acquire knowledge and understand scientific principles. In addition to the learning that kind of knowledge, students must master engineering, which will enable them to create new technologies and make dreams come to life. The experience of studying engineering is somewhat different from that of studying at high schools or in general education courses at universities. At the University&rsquo;s Faculty of Engineering, knowledge gained from studying is combined with the latest world-class research. Only through this integration of research and study is it possible for students to understand the true essence of engineering, a far-reaching and stimulating discipline that can bring significant changes to society. We want our students to be &ldquo;artists&rdquo; in the field of engineering. To that end, they are expected to have the courage and audacious creativity to draw a picture on a blank canvas. While we want our students to possess a deep level of expertise, we also hope that they will be interested in social issues affecting the real world and that they can afford to consider what is important regarding these issues, what the future direction of society will be, and other various matters. They are also expected to have the resolve and willingness to undertake these challenges that the real world presents.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>There is never just one solution to the problems that arise when formulating engineering plans, including everyday designs&mdash;not to mention when creating the technologies that lead the way towards innovations with societal impact. There are, in fact, a great number of solutions, depending on the approaches, ways of thinking and personalities of those attempting to find them. Engineering is a creative discipline. The Faculty of Engineering provides education and research that place emphasis on fostering diverse creativity. Scientific and technological research cannot be clearly categorized as either basic science or applied science. The Faculty of Engineering helps students to develop their creativity by offering not only courses for deepening technical expertise but also design workshops that require self-commitment, problem-solving projects, field trips, internships, workshop, FDP, STTP, orientation, TTP &nbsp;and graduation research.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe expect our students to take on important roles in the international arena in the future. The Faculty of Engineering provides lectures, experiments, as well as the latest research and a wide variety of international education and research programs that are all designed to prepare students to meet this expectation. What we want our students to acquire is not only expertise, but also the willingness and vigorous curiosity to learn a wide range of knowledge, a sense of ethics, a strong will to prevail in competition, the mental acumen and deep sensitivity for understanding the needs of society, the ability to discover and solve problems, a strong communication ability to facilitate mutual understanding, and a tolerance and feel for different multidisciplinary approach and cultures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngineering, indeed, is a field that infuses energy into society. The Faculty of Engineering hopes that all of our students will master this field and go on to flourish on the global stage.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<!--\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Dean (Engineering)</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/a1b77c23b5e9d6a548422014c23c0d20.jpg\" style=\"height:399px; width:600px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\"><span style=\"font-family:quicksand,sans-serif; font-size:14.4px\">Prof. (Dr.) Mohit Gangwar</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">B.Tech., M.Tech., Ph.D. (MNNIT, Allahabad)<br />\r\nContact No. (Office): 0755-4007621&nbsp;<br />\r\nContact No. (Mobile): +91-9336177550<br />\r\nEmail: mohitgangwar@gmail.com</span></strong></p>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(119, 119, 119); >Principal, Bhabha Engineering Research Institute (BERI) </span><br /> hide\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Prof. Gangwar received his B.Tech. and M.Tech. in Computer Science and Engineering.&nbsp;Prof. Gangwar has received his Ph.D. in Computer Science &amp; Engineering Department from MNNIT Allahabad.&nbsp; He has more than Sixteen years of academic, research and industrial experience in the field of Computer Science, Management and Information Technology.&nbsp;He has worked on several key positions in different reputed institutions. He has a vast experience of academic management and academic administration. He has published more than 50 research papers in various Journals and Conferences of repute.&nbsp; He has also attended a number of conferences, short term courses and workshops at IIT&rsquo;s and NIT&rsquo;s.&nbsp; His broad area of research is Intelligent Computing, Data Mining, Artificial Intelligence, Management, Information System, Business Intelligence, Semantic Web, Multi-Agent System and Medical Computing.&nbsp; He has taught B.Tech., BS, B.Arch., M.Tech., MBA, MCA, PGDM and MS level students in different institutions.&nbsp; He has also supervised and supervising various projects and dissertation/thesis at B.Tech. and M.Tech./Ph.D. level.&nbsp; He is also the Professional Member of Association for Computing Machinery (ACM) and reviewer of reputed journal and conference.&nbsp; He is the member of RDC, paper setter and thesis evaluator in different reputed universities.&nbsp; Apart from teaching, he has also carried out software development in various computer technologies.</strong></p>\r\n-->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Vision</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Our vision is to have a competent, innovative and nationally competitive national human resource with the ability to contribute to the socio-economic and educational advancement of the world. To provide a common platform for social, educational, economic, legal and environmental advancement of people in need.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Mission</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Our mission is to ensure open and equitable access to high- quality lifelong technical and vocational training of a nationally recognized standard, through the efficient and cost &ndash; effective use of resources, supporting economic diversification and growth. Provide education across world through channel.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Programmes Offered</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Diploma Engineering</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech.)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Master of Technology (M.Tech.)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Branches/Specialization</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">Diploma Engineering</span></strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\r\n	<li><strong>Civil Engineering</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Electrical Engineering</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Mechanical Engineering</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech.)</span></strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\r\n	<li><strong>Computer Science &amp; Engineering (CSE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Civil Engineering (CE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Electrical Engineering (EE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Electrical and Electronics Engineering (EEE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Electronics and Communication Engineering (ECE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Information Technology (IT)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Mechanical Engineering (ME)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">Master of Technology (M.Tech.)</span></strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\r\n	<li><strong>Construction Technology &amp; Management (CTM)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Computer Science &amp; Engineering (CSE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Digital Communication (DC)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Thermal Engineering (TE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Thermal Science and Engineering (TSE)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Power System (PS)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Very Large Scale Integration (VLSI)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3366ff\">Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)</span></strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\r\n	<li><strong>All Branches of Engineering</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Approvals &amp; Affiliations</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>All Three Engineering Institutes/Colleges are Approved from AICTE, New Delhi.</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>All Three Engineering Institutes/Colleges are Affiliated from Bhabha University, Bhopal.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Why You Choose BHABHA?</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><strong>Dedicated and highly motivated team of faculty and Qualified Experienced Faculties</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>A fine blend of experienced as well as dynamic youth as faculty</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Campus under CCTV surveillance</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Power generator Backup</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Well connectivity through Rail Bus</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Workshop on Robotics with Embedded System</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Workshop on Ethical Hacking</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Central Library with huge stock of books and local storage of video lectures from eminent lecturer</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Separate Hostel for Boys/Girls</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>24x7 hrs. high speed internet and Wi-Fi Campus</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Technical Motivation lectures by eminent professors from different reputed institutions of India</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Aptitude Classes provided regularly</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Gymnasium, Playground &ndash; Volleyball Court, Badminton Court etc.</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Annual sports event to encourage the student in sports</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Organized Teqip Sponsored STTP and FDP</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>We organize Technical Workshop to develop modern technical skills</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>We organize Technical Motivation lectures by eminent professors from different reputed institutions of India</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>National Programme on Technology Enhanced Learning (NPTEL) - Currently we are running all the Online Courses from NPTEL (MOOCS) in each semester</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>In House Solar Power Plant</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Excellent academic ambience</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>State-of-the-art infrastructural facilities</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Dynamic leadership with a clear vision and mission</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>In-house faculty development programmes conducted regularly for benefit of faculty</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>A highly disciplined environment for academic pursuits</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Value-added courses offered to students &bull; Formation of Technology Club of</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Departments, to study and practice the various aspects of engineering applications</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Innovation and Entrepreneurship Development Centre (IEDC) formed in the Faculty of Engineering for promoting entrepreneurship among the engineering students with the guidance Industry Experts</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Innovative management tool &lsquo;Strategic Planning Process&rsquo; practiced for the development of the institution</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>NCC and Scout Guide Training</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Community services like computer literacy for residents of nearby villages by National Service Schem Social commitment reflected in scholarships and tuition fee waiver schemes for academically brilliant, economically backward students</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Open House - Interaction of faculty, parents and students held every semester, to assess learning difficulties in students, and chalk out remedial programmes to improve their performance</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Excellent academic track record of students in university examinations</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>MoU with major Industries</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Consultancy services for external organizations</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Excellent track record in placement since 2003</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Alumni association - Bhabha has a strong community of successful and influential alumni who organize alumni association activities in major cities of India. They are the ambassadors of the institution and are a source of pride to Bhabha. They are supportive and helpful to the students of Bhabha.</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Online Fee Transfer Facility through PayTM.</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Our Graduate Attributes </span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><strong>We aim to foster these attributes in our students:</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Strong knowledge base in Engineering</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>In-depth knowledge in field of specialisation</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Problem Solving Skills</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Skill to investigate Engineering Problems</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Designing Solutions</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Utilize Modern Tools</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Individual and Team Work</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Inter Personal and Communication Skills</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Professionalism</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Safeguarding Environment and Society</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Ethical Values</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Lifelong Learning</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Institutes/Colleges</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(2,'PHARMACY','BHABHA UNIVERISY','fa fa-flask','<!--\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(204, 102, 0)\">Dean (Pharmacy)</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&ldquo;Education is not learning of facts but training of mind to think.&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:3in\"><strong>Elbert Einstein</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/daf8949100064c91be15e19871904c76.jpg\" style=\"height:175px; width:136px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Prof.(Dr.) Sailesh Kumar Ghatuary</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>We hope you enjoy exploring our academic, research, and service programs, as well as our achievements, history and traditions. The journey of RKDF School of Pharmaceutical science under BHABHA UNIVERSITY, Bhopal has been magnificent one. It was established in 2006 with the motive to provide quality pharmacy education at Under Graduate and Post Graduate labels.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>The college has made significant inroads in the sphere of pharmaceutical education, research and development. This has been achieved by outstanding student participation in various activities supported by highly qualified and motivated faculty, a state of Art infrastructure and virtual learning system. The Department of Pharmacy aims to thrive in the area of industrial as well as clinical and community based research. To accomplish this vision, Institute has highly sophisticated laboratories, well equipped machine rooms; central instrumentation facility, drug Information Centre, micro biology laboratory, Computer Aided Drug Design centre, which satisfies the practical and research need of the students.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>As said by Martin Luther King Jr &ldquo;Intelligence plus character that is the true goal of education&rdquo; we motivate students to inculcate social and professional values, inculcate a sense of discipline and character. We trained our students for peace studies and yoga apart from our curriculum to make our students physically and emotionally fit and mentally alerts. Our students are involved in the community through many volunteer efforts such as health camps, patient counseling, blood donation and health checkup.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Students are also actively involved with their faculty mentors in research projects. Students contribute to research topic selection, literature review, research design, data collection, analysis of results, understanding the mechanism of action of the drugs, presenting posters and publishing research paper in reputed journal.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>I am committed to the continued quest to enhance and improve our teaching and learning and research environment, so that we can provide a learning environment for the future pharmacy professionals. The school of pharmacy recently added cell biology laboratory. This is the first of its kind in all colleges in India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Prof.(Dr.) Sailesh Kumar Ghatuary</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>M.Pharm ,PhD, DSc.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Email ID: <a href=\"http://gmail.com\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"> bpri.acad@gmail.com </span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n-->',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(3,'DENTAL','','icon-caduceus8','<!--\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Dean &amp; Principal</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/210bd0c781a75325756c8e7570b0a760.jpg\" style=\"height:333px; width:500px\" /> </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#330099\">Prof. (Dr.) Manoj Mittal<br />\r\nBDS, MDS (Periodontology)<br />\r\nPrincipal, HOD.<br />\r\nDepartment of Periodontology,<br />\r\nBhabha College of Dental Sciences, Bhopal.<br />\r\nContact No. (Office): 0755-4282080, 4282086<br />\r\nEmail: bcdsbpl@gmail.com</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Dear Students,</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>It is my immense pleasure to welcome you all to the Bhabha College of Dental Sciences, Bhopal. Today we are living in a digital age where dentistry, much like all medicine, has greatly developed and improved. Nevertheless, many people are ignorant of the unbelievable advances that have occurred in the last 10 years. There have been significant advancements in technology like forensic dentistry, advanced material sciences, digital printing and genetics which have created vast and enormous opportunities to the future of this vocation.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Bhabha College of dental sciences, Bhopal is a constituent college of Bhabha University, which creates a platform where students can think out of the box and outshine the previous generation. We have the best faculties and I am proud to affirm that the success of our institution is owed in large part to the dedication of each faculty member. Our faculty is unique in that almost all of members have been awarded degrees from reputable universities of India as well as abroad. We are equipped with advanced machinery and equipment which facilitate the students. We are involved in research projects assisted by organisation such as ICMR, Bhabha University.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Our mission is to promote the core values and foster a learning environment that is conducive to producing tomorrow&rsquo;s leaders in dentistry, innovate on research to advance knowledge in the discipline, and transform knowledge into services to benefit the economic and social development in the region. We are embarking on a journey of building a future world, one great dentist at a time. I sincerely invite you to join us for the journey. Together let us make history.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n-->\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(4,'MANAGEMENT','','icon-accounting5','<h4><strong><span style=\"color:#003366\">MESSAGE FROM THE DEAN</span></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/c1424031b7e5a181ad5aff23a3550a0d.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:290px; margin:5px; width:300px\" /><strong><em>In today&rsquo;s rapidly evolving business landscape, organizations are becoming more dynamic, technology-driven, and globally integrated. The expectations from both management graduates and professionals are continuously rising, requiring individuals who are adaptable, innovative, and capable of making informed decisions from the very beginning of their careers. The BBA and MBA programs are thoughtfully designed to bridge the gap between academic knowledge and industry requirements.</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><em>While the BBA program lays a strong foundation in business concepts, communication, and managerial skills, the MBA program focuses on advanced strategic thinking, leadership development, and specialized knowledge essential for navigating complex corporate environments. At our institution, we strive to nurture future leaders who are intellectually competent, ethically grounded, and professionally agile. Through experienced faculty, industry interaction, practical exposure, and collaborative learning, we ensure that our students develop technical expertise, interpersonal effectiveness, and a global outlook. </em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><em>Our aim is to empower students to become confident decision-makers and responsible leaders who can contribute meaningfully to the growth of organizations and society at large.</em><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><strong>Dr. Breeze Tripathi</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(PhD (Management), MBA, and MA in Psychology)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/0597b0c1ff37b0f7336da9a61e1fe299.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:240px; margin:5px; width:300px\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">VISION</span></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚</strong> Aim to be the best management institute for developing competent and socially sensitive professionals striving for excellence.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚</strong> To provide high quality education to post graduate and doctoral students.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚</strong> The institute aims to produce leaders in management and related streams.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color:#003366\">MISSION</span></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>&nbsp;⮚&nbsp;</strong>To serve the society and improve the quality of life by imparting high quality education in management.</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;<strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>We aim to provide faculties for the students to achieve academic.</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;<strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>To develop the expertise for leadership and professionalism through student centric method and training and placement practices.<strong> </strong>To build strong relationship with the industry, alumni and academia to enhance learning.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color:#003366\">COURSES OFFERED</span></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;MBA (Master of Business Administration)</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;Ph.D (Doctor of philosophy)</strong>&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(5,'COMPUTER APPLICATIONS','Bhabha University','fa fa-laptop','<!--<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(204, 102, 0)\">Dean (Computer Application)</span></strong></h3>\r\n-->\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">FACULTY OF COMPUTER APPLICATIONS</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">MESSAGE FROM THE DEAN</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/be7c0087cd1bf1704d5aa3f296fae6fa.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:3px; height:285px; margin:5px 8px; width:628px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Prof. (Dr.) Deepa Bakhshi</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#cc6600\">(MCA, MBA, M. Tech, Ph.D)</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The technology has been changing very fast. Today, new packages, newer versions of current software and new technological tools are being adopted by the trade and industry periodically. The education therefore, must catch up with these developments well in time so that graduating, Post Graduating &nbsp;students do not face the problem of obsolescence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We feel the underlying concepts of new technology and tools along with reasonable skills be delivered to the students before they go out in the industry. Thus in a very fast changing technical scenario ,concept based education becomes quite important as against tool based education. Technological changes also demand that institutions must consider the market scenario, and adjust the contents and delivery of education matching the expectations of the business houses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Faculty&nbsp; of Computer Application prepares students to design, develop and implement software applications &nbsp;by providing best &nbsp;infrastructural facilities and a team of committed &amp; dedicated teachers.. The academic curriculum helps students develop technical, managerial and soft skills for careers in the IT industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">It is evolving into a center of excellence, providing quality technical education and producing competent professionals with high levels of credibility, integrity and ethical standards. Our goal is to recognize, respect and encourage the creative potential of each student. through&nbsp; continuous&nbsp; activities, academics&nbsp; and total involvement of our stakeholders.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In our Pursuit of&nbsp; Excellence, we focus on over &nbsp;all&nbsp; improvement of our Students&nbsp;and &nbsp;excellent placements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/0597b0c1ff37b0f7336da9a61e1fe299.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:3px; float:left; height:250px; margin:8px 5px; width:330px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">VISION</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>Imparting knowledge of Computer Applications to enable the graduates to meet the global needs and challenges.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">MISSION</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>Providing a strong theoretical and practical background across the computer&nbsp; science discipline with an&nbsp; emphasis on software development.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>To prepare students to become self sustained weavers in the development of our &nbsp;country and&nbsp; World.&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>To provide need based quality training in the field of Information Technology.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>Empowering the youth in rural communities with computer education.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>⮚&nbsp;</strong>To provide students with the tools to become productive, participating global &nbsp;citizens and life- long learners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<!-- \r\n<p><strong>Bachelor in Computer Application (BCA)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bachelor in Computer Application (<strong>BCA</strong>) is an undergraduate 3 Year degree <strong>course</strong> in computer applications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> This <strong>course</strong> provides a lot of opportunities to the students who are interested in computer field and wants to work in the IT sector as programmer or software developer.</p>\r\n-->',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(6,'EDUCATION','','fa fa-graduation-cap','<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><strong>FACULTY OF EDUCATION</strong></span><!--\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(204, 102, 0)\">Dean (Education)</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/73cc8b0e742dfb40bb29a3fa95d1ab79.jpeg\" style=\"height:183px; width:150px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>   Dr. Alok Sharma</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It gives me immense pleasure to welcome you all to the web portal of faculty of Education , Bhabha University Bhopal. We  offers  D. El Ed . , B Ed. ,  M . Ed . , BSc. B Ed.  program  approved by NCTE.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> college is a platform where  the students prepare themselves to face the world and we strive to  mould  the personalities of students in such a way that they can face the complex situations and challenges of life with confidence.  we provide a platform of activities for all round development youthful energies, properly channelized towards creativity and self actualization . our aim is pursuit of excellence in education which we try to achieve by incorporating and using latest innovative inculcating  values in the young minds , which will lead to refinement of the entire personality.   cooperation and perfect coordination from each member of College has helped us to create a Favorable  climate and there by maintaining quality education.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr. Alok Sharma<br />\r\nMSc, M.A, M.Ed, PhD in Education</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n--></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/257c9afee968aa6cdd3483e998b2c059.jpg\" style=\"height:227px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Dr. KAVITA PADEGAONKAR</span></strong><br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">M.A, M.Ed, PhD in Education</span></strong></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif\">Dean Massage</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:10.5pt\">Gaining knowledge alone is not Education, but it is that what makes us better human beings and so determines the future of the country. Education should help one to acquire life skills, there by live well, behave well to others and contribute his/her best to the society/nation/world. Ultimately the aim of Education should be the real peace in the world, where persons only use, develop and spread the positives in them.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:10.5pt\">Father of our nation, Mahatma Gandhi has beautifully observed the meaning of Education as &lsquo;the all-round drawing out of the best in child and man, in body, mind and spirit&rsquo;. Here in this College, we are in that effort to bring out the best in our student-teachers, in all aspects, so that they are equipped to do the same when they become the real teachers later. All the activities are organized here as a team work by the faculty to achieve this common goal. Thus Faculty of Education. College is scaling new heights in academic excellence and social commitment. BEST WISHES TO ALL.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(7,'HOTEL MANAGEMENT','','icon-cocktail32','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6600\">Dean (Hotel Management)</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/c664c6a4acaaa970ef5188ac39660dce.jpg\" style=\"height:177px; width:150px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Dr. Ashish Bhatt</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Dear Students,</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">It is my great pleasure to welcome you to the RKDF Institute of Hotel Management, Bhabha University, Bhopal. The Institute is focused on producing internationally competent professionals for the hospitality industry. The Institute offers industry relevant programs and seeks to equip students with right skills, knowledge and attitude needed to chart a career in travel, tourism and hospitality industry. Hospitality industry is global, glamorous, growth oriented and a rewarding industry. Career opportunities exist in Hotels, Restaurants, Cruise lines, Airlines, Railways, Retail, Hospitals, Clubs, Malls, Catering and Events &amp; Tourist Offices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Institute has state-of-the-art infrastructure comprising of Food Production Training Lab ( training Kitchens), Training Restaurant, Housekeeping and Front Office Labs to let students learn through practical approach. The TieUps with star category hotels enable students to aquire hands on experience. The strong industry linkages along with highly experienced &amp; well qualified faculty help to lead the next generation of hospitality professionals. The Institute offers Undergraduate, Diploma and Certificate programs which have been developed based on global hotel &amp; tourism management best practices. Research driven curriculum is geared to strengthen the foundation &amp; challenge the students to develop conceptual, analytical, technical &amp; managerial skills thus enabling them to compete and meet the changing needs in the challenging world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We look forward to welcome you in joining our journey and begin your career in Hospitality Industry &ndash; the world with limitless employment opportunities than any other industry. The expert faculty members of RKDF IHM will always strive to hone your skills, abilities and attributes to make you an &ldquo;Industry Ready Hospitality Professional.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dean,<br />\r\nDr. Ashish Bhatt, <br />\r\nHotel Management,<br />\r\nBhabha University, Bhopal.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(8,'AGRICULTURE','','fa fa-line-chart','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(9,'LAW','','fa fa-gavel','<p><strong>Dean (Law)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1f297e797723cfa1993993b42938f3ba.jpeg\" style=\"height:188px; width:150px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr. Shailendra Modi</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>&ldquo;Justice in the life and conduct of the State is possible only as first it resides in the hearts and souls of the citizens&rdquo;</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Facultuy of Law, Bhabha university extends a warm and hearty welcome to all the students who joining the three years LL.B.and five years B.A.LL.B. courses. Faculty of law envision to impart value based legal education with the commitment to serve society. Our aim is inspire students to learn and understand &nbsp;&ldquo;DHARMAM SARVAMPRATISHTITAM&rdquo;&nbsp; (Law is supreme and not the learners). It&nbsp; is the law alone that brings equality amongst unequal. Our Faculty of Law environment is conductive for student to acquire requisite skill-set as we encourage participation&nbsp; in various curricular and co- curricular activities such as Moot court competition , Trial Advocacy, Debates, Elocution, Conference, Workshop and Classroom Discussions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Being fully conscious of the fact that law and society are interrelated and interdependent and the importance of law in the light of globalization. With the best infrastructure and well- equipped library, we provide our students the best opportunities in exploring the world of legal knowledge. Our goal is to imbibe core values of discipline, punctuality and ethics which are quintessential to student&rsquo;s progress. Our teacher have vast experience and expertise in the field of law. We aim to build leaders who shall stands for social, political and economic justice. It is the vision of the Faculty of Law to establish a nexus between the theoretical and the practical aspects of the profession. &ldquo;Quality is never an accident, it is the result of hard work, determination and perseverance.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr. Shailendra Modi</strong><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>M.Com, LL.M, Ph.D</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(10,'COMMERCE','','fa fa-calculator','<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:source sans pro,sans-serif; font-size:16px\">Message from the Dean</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/a8e3c15883e423538eccf0cf82f9be9e.jpg\" style=\"height:182px; width:150px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>Dr. Deepa Bakhshi</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>O<em>rganizations are turning lean, knowledge based, boundary-less and flat. The demand from the corporate sector is changing with every minute. The strategic vision of the world and the challenging corporate requirements need a new breed of global managers who are capable of delivering quality from day one. We, at Bhabha University aspire to abridge this gap by creating professionals, who are intellectually strong, morally sound and professionally vibrant .The <strong>Commerce</strong> program is aimed at developing the skills required to lead and manage corporate in the rapidly globalizing networked economy. Mentoring by the outstanding teachers, association with effective business leaders and motivated peers are provided to develop technical, interpersonal and conceptual skills of students.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Dr. Deepa Bakhshi</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(MCA.MBA,MTech, Ph D)</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(11,'SCIENCE','','fa fa-flask','<!--\r\n<p>Dean (Science)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/14f66101a293e0b55cb480bae35aa88e.jpg\" style=\"height:195px; width:150px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr Neha Singh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><strong>\"Education is the most powerful weapon which you can use to change the world.\"</strong></em>  ― Nelson Mandela</p>\r\n\r\n<p>“Education is the manifestation of love and my most cherished possession. Education drives away ignorance and through illumination it emboldens a man to a righteous thought and action. It empowers a woman and enlarges the horizon of her mind. It energizes a society and enables a man to earn his living with respect and praise. Hence my love for it”.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am greatly rejoiced and proudly place on record the fact that University teaching department of Science affiliated with Bhabha university, Bhopal, the visionary dream of its founder Chairman Dr. Sunil Kapoor – a humble servant of education whose little mission a decade ago to transform a small college into a big one, has unfolded into an institution of glorious past and great future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In order to accomplish our vision and mission, we are prepared to take as much effort as possible for the betterment of academic scenario in India. We believe that education is an effective medium of social transformation. We get encouragement, looking at bright and successful careers of our thousands of students, which subsequently benefit the society. We feel proud that we are part of such an excellent institute, which is shaping modern India.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>University teaching department of Science endowed with progressive futuristic outlook aims continual growth in the quality of all academic activities with a sense of commitment to fully meet the expectations of the students, parents and society.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our college cares for the individual development of each and every student. We follow “mentor system” under which each class is put into the multi-pronged web of a teacher. We accord prime importance to the behavioral discipline, moral integrity and cognitive developments of our students. Our teachers strive to teach not only academic programmes but also life skills needed for students’ self development with highly resourceful faculty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I wish the best of fortune, peace and prosperity to all those who contribute to the noble task of spreading education and its manifest qualities, aims and objectives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr. Neha Singh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dean of Science,  Bhabha University.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>B.Sc., M.Sc., M. Phil. (Physics),</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ph.D. (Physics) (MANIT, Bhopal), B.Ed., PGDCA.</p>\r\n-->',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(12,'ART',NULL,'fa fa-paint-brush',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(13,'NURSING','Nursing','fa fa-plus-square','<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#cc3300\">FACULTY OF NURSING</span></strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(204, 102, 0)\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1a367de501f3a20a79c86e27208b2b12.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:2px; height:710px; margin:5px; width:1280px\" /></span></strong></p>\r\n<!--\r\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/fec4c833c1f40bb5f091320bc7e39e14.jpg\" style=\"border-style:none; border-width:1px; float:left; height:276px; width:353px\" /> Dr. Jalpana Adhikary (Principal)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>(B.Sc. Nursing, M.Sc. Nursing(Medical Surgical Nursing), Ph.D. (N</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Published varies research paper in International & National Journals</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Member Board of Studies in varies University</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Member of TNAI, SOMI, NRSI & NTAI</strong></p>\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<p>Faculty of Nursing Bhabha University is one of the leading institutes for nursing education in Madhya Pradesh. A goal to import education with students in order to mould them as true nursing personal, who can serve the community, country and world with excellent practical skill and advance knowledge. We believe in all round development of student for wholesome individual and confident personality. The college fraternity encourages the students to meet the complex challenges and build the carrier in the filed of nursing. Undergraduate nursing program is broad based education within an academic framework specially directed to the development of critical thinking skills.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(14,'LIBRARY SCIENCE','','fa fa-book','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(15,'PARAMEDICAL','','fa fa-medkit','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(16,'HOMOEOPATHIC','','icon-caduceus8','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1);
