kj'),(7927,'Vivek Kumre','vivekkumre344@gmail.com','7067743388','Diploma ag','H'),(7928,'Vivek Kumre','vivekkumre344@gmail.com','7067743388','Diploma ag','H'),(7929,'Lesley Rigg','lesley.rigg@hotmail.com','08315266503','Extract old entire property back using Restorix','Hey,\r\n\r\nThe Expired Domain Goldmine\r\n\r\nThere are thousands of expired domains sitting on auction platforms right now with strong backlink profiles, domain authority, and traffic history, and most buye');
