inar/ILS-IIC 4.0','conference-seminar-ils-iic-4-0','Research','Conference /Seminar/ILS-IIC 4.0','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Impact Lecture Series Phase-II</span></strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QVg2ca0HBc8\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Entrepreneurship &amp; Innovation as Career Opportunity </span></a></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><!-- <p><strong> INTERNATIONAL / NATIONAL CONFERENCE </strong></p>\r\n--></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">1<sup>st</sup>&nbsp;INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE </span></strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ON</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">EMERGING TRENDS IN MULTI&nbsp; DISCIPLINARY RESEARCH </span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">ETIMDR - 2021 </span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">06-07 August&nbsp; 2021</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><strong>OUR ESTEEMED KEY NOTE SPEAKER</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"OUR ESTEEMED KEY NOTE SPEAKERS\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/5a1ed665435f17b8d1468b0d6dadb398.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:690px; width:819px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Paper on any of the theme of the conference should reach the convener of the&nbsp; conference on or before deadline at&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">conferencebhabha@gmail.com</span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Important Dates&nbsp;</span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Abstract Submission Deadline&nbsp; :&nbsp; &nbsp;22 July 2021</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Paper Submission Deadline&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; :&nbsp; &nbsp;27&nbsp; July&nbsp; 2021</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp; Acceptance Notification&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; :&nbsp; &nbsp;28&nbsp; July 2021</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Registration&nbsp; Deadline&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:&nbsp; &nbsp;31&nbsp; July 202</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Help Desk</span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp;Dr. Kavita Padegaonkar&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 9993289569&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp;Mr. Arvind&nbsp; Singh Rajput&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 9713806383&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Ms Abhilasha&nbsp; Diwedi&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 7024612817</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Ms Sweta Sanodiya&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 8720856060</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Organizing secretary</span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp;Dr. Deepa Bakhshi</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp;Director and Dean&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp;Bhabha University&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>7000820896, </strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>berimcabpl@gmail.com</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>Registration link for conference click here : <a href=\"https://forms.gle/msoWJUUJbLhD8wx98\" onclick=\"window.open(this.href, \'REGISTRATIONFORM\', \'resizable=no,status=no,location=no,toolbar=no,menubar=no,fullscreen=no,scrollbars=yes,dependent=yes,width=500,left=35,height=600,top=25\'); return false;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">REGISTRATION FORM</span></a></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>BROCHURE</strong> <a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/f99ae3e4f7a457403dc527af1e69ea87.pdf\"><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">DOWNLOAD</span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n',1),(11,'Industrial Visits','industrial-visits','Research','Industrial Visits','<p>Industrial Visits</p>\r\n',1),(12,'Admission Process','admission-process','Admissions','Admission Process','<h3><strong>ADMISSION PROCEDURES FLOWCHART</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"admission flowchart\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/0b05d2594628cbb555716b564a2dd590.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; margin:2px; width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"abt_univ_des\">\r\n<h3><strong>ADMISSION RULES/GUIDELINES</strong>:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">For the information about the courses offered under various Constituent Institutions and the Teaching Departments of the University along with the details like admission rules, seat intake, minimum eligibility criteria for admission, basis of seat allotment, please refer Bhabha Unversity Website</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Process of counseling and admissions starts from 1st April 2024 and continues till last date of admissions.</strong> It will be held on every working day of University on the basis of merit marks obtained in the entrance examination (if require) or on the basis of the marks obtained in qualifying examination</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">In case of Lockdown or any other circumstances University may also conduct Online Counselling, with due Approvals After Online Counselling students must submit all original documents for verification to counseling department.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Original TC/Leaving Certificate, Character Certificate and Migration Certificate will be submitted in the allotted constituent institutions or teaching departments.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Seats allotment in courses will be done -- first on the basis of marks obtained in entrance examination (if required) and thereafter for all the remaining seats on the basis of marks obtained in the qualifying examination.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Seats allotment for reserved category will de done as per the ordinance of Bhabha University which comprises of respective Regulatory Bodies/ Govt. of Madhya Pradesh directives.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Applicant shall ensure the requirement of minimum educational qualification eligibility and age (if required) at the time of application submission. The admission of applicant will be confirmed only on the fulfillment of minimum educational eligibility criteria and submission of semester/yearly fees</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">At the time of admission confirmation, applicant shall submit original documents of Transfer Certificate, Character Certificate, Migration Certificate, five Passport Photos, online or offline Anti-Ragging affidavit, first semester/year tuition fees, Hostel or Transport Fees (if applicable) and other Fee of University at the Counseling Office of the University. Please note that the verification of all documents will also be carried out in the allotted constituent Institutions or teaching department of university and applicant shall submit two sets of self attested zerox copies of all the documents.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Applicant shall ensure to fill correct permanent address, telephone nos, mobile nos, Email Id, Aadhar number and blood group at the time of admission in the Application Form and Online ERP Section.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">University administration can change the admission guidelines time to time which shall be displayed and should be got confirmed from the University Website.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Applicant and parents shall ensure to visit the university website regularly.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">In case of cancellation of admission, candidate needs to apply for cancelation of admission to counseling office of the university before 06 days from the last date of admission. And only tuition fees will be refunded after 10% deduction but other fees is non-refundable.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Enclosed following photo copies of all self attested documents in two sets along with the application form:</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Valid admit card and merit score of entrance examination (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Mark sheet of qualifying examination</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Mark sheet of Higher secondary examination or 10+2 examination</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Mark sheet of 10th examination or secondary examination</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Domicile certificate</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Caste certificate issued by competent authority (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Income certificate issued by competent authority (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Percentage/marks conversion authorized documents of respective Board/University (Applicable only in case Grade based mark sheet)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Permanent address proof</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Aadhar Card</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Five colour passport size photographs</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Documents required in original form:</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Original Anti-Ragging Affidavits of Student and Parent.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Original TC/College or School Leaving Certificate.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Original Character Certificate.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Original Migration Certificate.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">List of original documents required for verification</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Valid admit card and merit score of entrance examination (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Mark sheet of qualifying examination</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Mark sheet of Higher secondary examination or 10+2 examination</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Mark sheet of 10th examination or secondary examination</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Domicile certificate</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Caste certificate issued by competent authority (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Income certificate issued by competent authority (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Percentage/marks conversion authorized documents of respective Board/University (Applicable only in case Grade based mark sheet)</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Permanent address proof</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Aadhar Card</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>On recommendation of respective Councils/ Govt. of Madhya Pradesh/ Madhya Pradesh Private University Regulatory Commission, there can be change in University Admission Guidelines 2024-25 for Seat intake capacity, courses, Admission dates and procedure and minimum eligibility criteria. The changes shall be updated regularly and could be seen on University website, from time to time. </strong><br />\r\n<strong>In case of any dispute, the final decision will be of the Vice Chancellor of Bhabha University Bhopal</strong></span></div>\r\n',1),(13,'Scholarship','scholarship','Admissions','Scholarship','<div class=\"abt_univ_des\">\r\n<p>MP Scholarship&nbsp;program is for those students, who are in between&nbsp;9<sup>th&nbsp;</sup>standard to Post Graduation. A significant factor in the percentage is reserved for the girl students. Every year many students get profit through this&nbsp;Mp Scholarship&nbsp;program that is exactly what it is meant for. Eligibility criteria can be different in different years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So the candidate can apply for one of them. If the applicants do not follow this, then their application can be canceled. One thing can bubble up in your head that could be about income certificates. So this might vary a little bit as per the rules of the government. But that could be&nbsp;not more than 2 Lakhs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Criteria for scholarships that come under MP Scholarship:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>1. Mukhyamantri Medhavi Vidyarthi Yojana, Madhya Pradesh</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>This scholarship is for those students who have passed their&nbsp;<strong>12th with 75% or more&nbsp;</strong>from the state board and&nbsp;<strong>85% or more from CBSE/ICSE</strong>. The annual income should not exceed<strong>&nbsp;INR 6 Lakhs</strong>. If the candidate is an engineering student, then their&nbsp;<strong>JEE Mains Rank should be till 50,000 or less.&nbsp;</strong>Medical or dental students should have cleared their&nbsp;NEET<strong>&nbsp;exam.</strong>&nbsp;Law students should have cleared their&nbsp;<strong>CLAT exam and got into NLU.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>2. Post Matric Scholarship Scheme for OBC Students, Madhya Pradesh</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>The student should belong to the OBC Category, and family income should be<strong>&nbsp;less than 75,000/- for 100% scholarship&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>1,00,000 for 50% scholarship.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>3. Mukhya Mantri Jan Kalyan Yojana (MMJKY), Madhya Pradesh</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>If your parent is an unorganized workman under the&nbsp;<strong>department of Labour in Madhya Pradesh</strong>, then this scholarship is for you. This scholarship is for students getting into&nbsp;<strong>undergraduate, postgraduate, diploma, polytechnic, or any ITI stream</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students getting into engineering should have their<strong>&nbsp;JEE Mains ranks till 1,50,000 or below.&nbsp;</strong>Medical students should have qualified&nbsp;<strong>JIPMER&nbsp;</strong>or&nbsp;<strong>AIIMS&nbsp;</strong>examination for the&nbsp;<strong>BBS course</strong>. Law students have to qualify for the CLAT exam and got into one of the NLUs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>4. Post Matric Scholarship Scheme for the SC Students, Madhya Pradesh</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>After the secondary level, students belonging to the Scheduled Caste category can apply for this scholarship.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>5. Post Matric Scholarship Scheme for the ST Students, Madhya Pradesh</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>This scholarship is for the students belonging to the Scheduled Tribe category. If the annual family income from all the sources is&nbsp;<strong>less than INR 2,50, 000</strong>&nbsp;then you are eligible for&nbsp;<strong>100% scholarship</strong>, and if it&rsquo;s between&nbsp;<strong>INR 2,50,000 to 6,00,000,&nbsp;</strong>then you are eligible for&nbsp;<strong>50% scholarship.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Documents required</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Photocopy of Caste Certificate</li>\r\n	<li>Photocopy of MP Domicile certificate</li>\r\n	<li>Photocopy of Income certificate of Parents</li>\r\n	<li>Passport size photos</li>\r\n	<li>Residential proof &ndash; Adhar Card/Voter Id card</li>\r\n	<li>Photocopy of 10<sup>th</sup> Marksheet</li>\r\n	<li>Photocopy of 12<sup>th</sup> Marksheet</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Home page of MP Scholarship 2.0</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In the official website of the MP Scholarship, you are provided every scholar scheme. To get to know that you need to type<strong>&nbsp;MP Scholarship 2.0</strong>&nbsp;on the search bar. This search will take you to the main page from where you can state filling the application form at any time. This is the best platform for those students, who are studying in MP.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are pursuing the post-matric course, you then need to take a look over there timely. To access the website, you are needed to have an internet connection and data. The best part is that&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship 2.0</strong>&nbsp;can be accessed by a mobile set as well. If you do not have a personal computer and a laptop, then there is nothing to get bothered about.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Scholarship Application&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many times, some applicants commit a mistake while filling the MP Scholarship Application form and that is they do pay attention while putting the mobile number and email. This is very important to put that mobile number that you are not going to change. It is not arduous to get that all information regarding your&nbsp;<strong>MP state Scholarship</strong>&nbsp;will be sent on your existing mobile number.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whatever the status will be of your scholarship application, you can only be informed when your mobile will be working. Suppose, if you are pursuing a three-year graduation course in your favorite field. Now, you are in the second year. But you have charged your SIM number. Now, you would not be able to get the information regarding your MP scholarship.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>MP Scholarship Application Form Submission Guide</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>After completing the documents and photographs, you can fill the form online. You need to go to the official website where you can find the home button. You then need to click on that. Now, you will be the right place for the&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship portal</strong>.</li>\r\n	<li>Now, if you are a new applicant, you have not filled this scholarship application before, you then should click on the bar to register yourself. The best thing about this website is that the interface is designed in such a way that you will not find it difficult in filling the form.&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>If you are already getting the scholarship and you want to renew it, then you need to click on the student login bar. So when you start registering yourself for the first time and click on that, you then see some indispensable guidelines on the&nbsp;<strong>Mp Scholarship portal&nbsp;</strong>regarding the application<strong>.&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li>All candidates are suggested to read these points carefully. Please take this point a little seriously and do not skip. The applicants can also apply for this scholarship program by the officially launched app. Otherwise, you can go through the official website.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>MP Scholarship Login</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to go to an internet caf&eacute; to get your MP scholarship application filled, you then can do it by yourself with a mobile set. You can easily&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship login</strong>&nbsp;with a mobile app. If you have registered for this scholarship program and you want to see the current scholarship status, you then need to login.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The government of Madhya Pradesh is offering different scholarship programs based on a variety of interests or fields. So make&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship login</strong>, and get to know about all scholarship programs. But an applicant can apply one of them. The best part is that it is really easy to apply.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>MP Scholarship KYC</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you do not have an idea about the&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship&nbsp;</strong>KYC form, then you need to know this. KYC is known as Know Your Customer. It is a verification process in order to identify the customer. It has to be done if you are doing a financial deal through your bank account.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are two ways to get an&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship kyc</strong>&nbsp;online. For knowing it well you can either the official website or you can get done by an internet caf&eacute;. But some people try to do their KYC process through OTP and they find the process fails and not responding. It happens due to a little wrong information in the documents.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But you do not need to get bothered about it because there is another way to get an MP<strong>&nbsp;Scholarship key</strong>. To file the KYC, you need to go to the bank or any person who does KYC. Another way of KYC filing is done through Biometric.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Have a glance at MP Scholarship details</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>The applicants are needed to have a glance at&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship details</strong>&nbsp;before they start filling the application form. When you go ahead with filling the form, you are shown some details. That everyone is needed to read well.&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Madhya Pradesh Government also offers some other scholarship programs. There are some students who apply for those. If you are not getting needed&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholar details</strong>, you then need to surf on the official website. You can find every needed information and guidelines over there.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>eScholarship portal MP</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Applicants now can check their status of MP Scholarship at any time on&nbsp;eScholarship<strong>&nbsp;portal MP</strong>&nbsp;whenever they want. The Government of MP has launched an app through which you cannot only check out your status but also it gives service to fill the application form.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The&nbsp;<strong>eScholarship portal MP</strong>&nbsp;is available in both Hindi and English language. It is designed in such a way so that you would find any difficulty. You are provided every service on this portal. You will be given all the dates like application date and last date of filling the application over there.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The candidates are suggested to register for your notification. For that, they are needed to register their mobile number and email. So any information regarding the scholarship programs will be sent to your SIM number. You are suggested to do so.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Minority Scholarship MP&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The MP Government wants to encourage the students from minority communities by the implementation of&nbsp;<strong>minority Scholarship MP</strong>. It is basically intended for the welfare of the meritorious students who belong to minority communities. This scholarship program is the best initiative for financial help for the majority of communities. This is the key objective of the Government of Madhya Pradesh.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many parents do not encourage their children to get educated because of the paucity of fees. So to encourage them, so they do not be deprived of getting what exactly they deserve. This is the main goal of&nbsp;<strong>minority Scholarship MP</strong>. So if you come in the category of minority and you want to study further, you then no need to worry about it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>FAQ</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to check scholarship status in MP?</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ans.&nbsp;</strong>If you want to know the status of your scholarship, then here some points available that you should go through. It is very important to be aware of where your scholarship holds right now.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>1.&nbsp;</strong>To check the&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship status</strong>, you can figure out through the website and official app as well. So first, you need to open the official website of the MP Scholarship. You then need to click on the home bar. On this page, you can see a highlighted headline about checking or tracking application status.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>2.</strong>&nbsp;You simply can see some scholarships given over there. So you need to click on that one which belongs to you. As you click on this link, it takes you on the new page. Now, you can see two blocks where you need to put your application ID and year of academics. You then need to click on the submit button.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>3.&nbsp;</strong>After clicking the button, you can see the current&nbsp;<strong>Mp Scholarship status</strong>&nbsp;of yours. You can get to know when your scholarship was released and where it is currently over this page. It is very easy to figure out the status of your scholarship at any time. You do not have to charge to figure out the status.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to fill MP scholarship form online?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ans.&nbsp;</strong>After completing the documents and photographs, you can fill the MP Scholarship form online. You need to go to the official website where you can find the home button. You then need to click on that. Now, you will be the right place for the&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship portal</strong>.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow, if you are a new applicant, you have not filled this scholarship application before, you then should click on the bar to register yourself. The best thing about this website is that the interface is designed in such a way that you will not find it difficult in filling the form.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How can I get KYC in MP scholarship?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ans.&nbsp;</strong>There are two ways to get an&nbsp;<strong>MP Scholarship kyc</strong>&nbsp;online. For knowing it well you can either the official website or you can get done by an internet caf&eacute;. But some people try to do their KYC process through OTP and they find the process fails and not responding. It happens due to a little wrong information in the documents.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut you do not need to get bothered about it because there is another way to get an MP<strong>&nbsp;Scholarship key</strong>. To file the KYC, you need to go to the bank or any person who does KYC. Another way of KYC filing is done through Biometric.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How do I renew my MP scholarship form?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ans.&nbsp;</strong>If you are already getting the MP scholarship and you want to renew it, then you need to click on the student login bar. So when you start registering yourself for the first time and click on that, you then see some indispensable guidelines on the&nbsp;<strong>Mp Scholarship portal&nbsp;</strong>regarding the application<strong>.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What is the&nbsp;</strong>post-matric scholarship<strong>&nbsp;scheme?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ans.&nbsp;</strong>The Ministry of Minority Affairs launches the post-Matric Scholarships scheme, Government of India, to support the education of students studying at the post-secondary or post-matriculation&nbsp;level. Those students who want to go for higher education from Class 11 to the postgraduate level can apply to this Scholarship.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><u>Similarly Students from other states such as Uttar Pradesh, Bihar etc has to apply at their respective State Scholarship Portals to avail benefit of Scholarship</u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n',1),(14,'PhD student (List)','phd-student-list-','Research','PhD student (List)','<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1505c55b201dd04ac08cdb645d5c477e.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\">List of Ph.D. awarded</span></span></a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/32a81fd243dd6b6d5213bffa855e6ae3.pdf\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ph.D Awarded Student List Batch 2018-19</span></a></strong></p>\r\n',1),(15,'Journal','journal','Research','Journal','<p>Journal</p>\r\n',1),(16,'Online Examination Alert','online-examination-alert','Examinations','Online Examination Process','<h3><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/d5b18546645b7d344dc0fe1541806b2e.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Bhabha University Online Exam Process</span></strong></a></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',1),(17,'Mission & Vision','mission-vision','About','Mission & Vision','<div class=\"abt_univ_des\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Vision</strong>:The vision of the university is to provide high quality education to diploma courses, undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral students. The university also aspires to contribute to the society through teaching and research to help achieve global sustainability. Further, the Institute aims to produce leaders in science and related disciplines.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Mission</strong>: To provide greater access for higher education to all and in particular to the socially and educationally unprivileged youth upholding the principle of social equity.To make learning in science and other knowledge streams exciting through excellent integrative teaching strategies driven by curiosity and creativity. To facilitate and promote entry into research at an early age through a flexible borderless curriculum and research projects. To encourage and facilitate inter-institutional and international exchange programs and collaborations in teaching and research</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n',1),(18,'Our Values','our-values','About','Our Values','<div class=\"abt_univ_des\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">In fulfilling our mission, the faculty, staff, and students of the Bhabha University are committed to the following values as an institution and in our actions as individuals</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Accountability</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Collaboration</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Diversity &amp; Inclusiveness</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Entrepreneurism</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Integrity</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Professionalism</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Respect</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Leadership</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Discovery &amp; innovation</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Social responsibility</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">People: Success, diversity</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Learning: Discovery, innovation, scholarship</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Partnerships: Regional, entrepreneurial, global</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Relationships: Collegial, professional, ethical</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Sustainability: Social justice, economic opportunity, environmental protection</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Stewardship: Fiscal, intellectual<a name=\"diversity\"></a></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Core Values are at the heart of our Education. They define who we are, how we work and guide how we act with each other and with other stakeholders. They&rsquo;re our DNA.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>INTEGRITY</strong>:&nbsp;We build relationships through trust, honesty and&nbsp;respect</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>PASSION &amp; PRIDE:</strong>&nbsp;We love what we do and strive for excellence</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>CARE:</strong>&nbsp;We put our students and their goals at the heart of&nbsp;everything we do</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>CREATIVITY:</strong>&nbsp;We are not afraid to be different and we celebrate&nbsp;innovation Oh, and we believe that a&nbsp;SMILE&nbsp;goes a long way&hellip;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Our Core Values are the foundation of our Mission and Vision Statements.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/ad29064433d4b7df30f6450def9b5eb8.pdf\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:#FFFF00\">Institute Development Program</span></strong></span></a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n',1),(19,'Why Choose Bhabha University','why-choose-bhabha-university','About','Why Choose Bhabha University','<div class=\"abt_univ_des\">\r\n<p>BHABHA University is a research intensive university with an outstanding reputation for its learning environments across a broad range of disciplines. Our commitment to our students is evident in our graduates, who are recognised for their capability, quality and success in the globally. The BHABHA University has been equipped with excellent physical and academic infrastructure, latest curriculum, and improved teaching methodology</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best talent has been recruited as faculty, industry interaction and practical exposure makes the learning process at the university dynamic. BHABHA University aspires to be among the best universities in the world in next coming year through a series of strategically crafted moves, precisely calibrated action plans and an unwavering commitment to the pursuit of excellence. Our aim is to make BHABHA University as one of the best centers of excellence in higher studies and research in science and related areas. BHABHA University is situated in Bhopal, the beautiful &ldquo;City of Lakes&rdquo;, capital of Madhya Pradesh. The ambience and serenity of a world-class infrastructure housed in a &#39;Clean &amp; Green&#39; campus. h</p>\r\n</div>\r\n',1),(20,'About University','about-university','About','About University','<div class=\"abt_univ_des\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>BHABHA UNIVERSITY</strong> opened its door with the establishment of&nbsp;Bhabha Group of Institutions in 2003 and is promoted by Ayushmati Education and Social Society. Later during the year 2018 Bhabha Goroup of Institute is developed into Bhabha University. &nbsp;&quot;BHABHA UNIVERSITY&rdquo; (established by the Act of Madhya Pradesh Legislature and is notified in the Official Gazette extra-ordinary) of the State Government of Madhya Pradesh. BHABHA University is sponsored by AYUSHMATI EDUCATION AND SOCIAL SOCIETY. Bhabha Group of Institutions has been challenging and developing great minds for more than a decade. Interdisciplinary research training is the key to the success of tomorrow&rsquo;s life scientists, as the motto of the University states. The Bhabha University&nbsp; provides a world class environment of&nbsp;research institutions, which have a long and successful tradition of cooperation across faculties. It is successfully running various Institutions in discipline of Engineering &amp; Technology, Pharmacy, Dental, Hotel Management and Catering Technology, Computer Applications, Management, and Education etc for last 15 years in the central India.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">The ambience and serenity of a world-class infrastructure housed in a &#39;Clean &amp; Green&#39; campus. The University has been equipped with excellent physical and academic infrastructure, latest curriculum, and improved teaching methodology. Students learn the basics of chemistry, biology, physics and physiology as well as molecular biology, pharmaceutical technologies.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">The Bhabha University is an urban research university that has driven new ways of thinking since 2003. Our commitment to&nbsp;free and open inquiry&nbsp;draws inspired scholars to our&nbsp;global campuses, where ideas are born that challenge and change the world.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">We empower individuals to challenge conventional thinking in pursuit of original ideas. Students in the&nbsp;College&nbsp;develop critical, analytic, and writing skills in our&nbsp;rigorous, interdisciplinary core curriculum. Through&nbsp;graduate programs, students test their ideas with scholars, and become the next generation of leaders in academia, industry, nonprofits, and government We generate new insights for the benefit of present and future generations with our&nbsp;national and affiliated laboratories. In all we do, we are driven to dig deeper, push further, and&nbsp;ask bigger questions&mdash;and to leverage our knowledge to enrich all human life. Our diverse and creative students and alumni&nbsp;drive innovation, lead international conversations, and make masterpieces.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n',1),(21,'BOOKS & LIBRARY','books-library','Home','BOOKS & LIBRARY','<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#cc6600\">Central Library </span></strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/e1a53f458e1d1569c9d7f83be5d971f9.jpg\" /></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">This is one of the pillars for the progress of the Bhabha University. It has well equipped, computerized library with comprehensive database of about Thousands of&nbsp; books and&nbsp; journals on engineering, science and technology,&nbsp; Pharmacy, dental science,&nbsp; Agriculture,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Law, which includes exclusive current reference publications.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&bull; Library Members: 3000+</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&bull; Reprographic facility: Xeroxing, printing &amp; scanning</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&bull; Working hours of library: 09:30 A.M.to06.30P.M.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&bull; Library networking facility: High Speed LAN</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&bull; Data usages of the library: 99%</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (In terms of books issued to the faculty &amp; students etc)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&bull; Internet Facility</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">To promote the technical knowledge.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Generation and application of knowledge &amp; resources.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Effective dissemination of knowledge.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Library automation and networking for remote access of online electronic resources.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Improves the library resources.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Part of consortium for effective sharing e-resource.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Develop as a resource full information center for Student.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">To improve capability in information transfer and access, that provides support to the technical education.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Enhance the student experience</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Build the digital research environment</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Provide convenient and customized access to information</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Maintain and develop community partnerships</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(204, 102, 0)\">On line Open Access Books</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>S.No.</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Source</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>URL</strong></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Subjects</strong></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\">\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">1.</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Google my library</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:26px; width:175px\">\r\n			<p><a href=\"http://www.google.com/googlebooks/mylibrary/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">http://ww