sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"clear:both;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">Research and publication</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/de33e1e280eec8dc2a1408bd2ff71bf4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Research and publication list faculty wise</span></a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',1),(16,9,'Department of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery','<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">Department of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">OVERVIEW</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Headed by Dr Anisha Maria has been focused on Hands on training in Basic life support and injection techniques to our students. The highest number of webinar&rsquo;s have been conducted for UG students by the department. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The focus is on all around development of the students not just on acquiring oral surgical skills but to become better humans and to develop thier personalities by encouraging public speaking skills The department has skilled staff which is providing treatment for jaw fractures, cysts and tumors, removal of impacted teeth and placement of implants. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/eecf211418ffc6b8d85648c4a87b1aa6.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1beea08abfdabe58d7f898558bc3a3bc.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">FACULTY MEMBERS</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/5ec8c2302f55103f8c7b4b2c0e79fb4f.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></span></strong></u></p>\r\n',1),(17,9,'Department of Conservative Dentistry & Endodontics ','<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">Department of Conservative Dentistry &amp; Endodontics</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">OVERVIEW</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The Department of Conservative Dentistry &amp; Endodontics came into existence since the inception of the institute at the pre doctoral levels since 2008 and the postdoctoral levels since 2018. The department has staff strength for 09 Post graduate students. It deals with diagnosis, treatment planning and restoration of teeth to reproduce esthetics and function. It also deals with smile designing, esthetic dentistry which includes bleaching of teeth, laminates and veneers. Endodontics is a branch which deals with root canal treatment and periapical surgeries. The Department of Endodontics strives to transfer evidence based knowledge to predoctoral and advanced education students through an interdisciplinary coordinated curriculum and, to the profession at large through relevant continuing education.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">Vision:</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To create restorative dentists with superior knowledge and psychomotor skills, who are able to give the best possible care to patients, whilst at the same time, providing for themselves a top-quality life style, and opportunities of employment and further education.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">Mission:</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To impart the highest quality of education to students and shape them to be good professionals with credibility, integrity and ethical conscience</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To bring out high standards in teaching and learning with more focus on problem based learning &amp; evidence based dentistry</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To provide quality treatment using state-of-the-art instruments and equipments with equal care &amp; compassion towards the patients</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The department promotes the concept of life-long learning and actively participates in the advancement and dissemination of knowledge through research and publication.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/b729ab6ea90c872e9aacae7a8d6a80b2.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/9ce57a781576b3927885cf063b14c8c0.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/6a7179f1eb35040c80172056d87e917b.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">MDS 1<sup>ST</sup> BATCH EXAM 2021</span></strong></u></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/f44022d9efd1f8330e5c051984a8582a.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></span></strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\">FACULTY MEMBERS</span></strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong><span style=\"color:#000080\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/e931742ae5e7b3cd873c7ec5a834e365.jpg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></span></strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<!-- new dental FL hided \r\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:884px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:25px; width:63px\">\r\n			<p><strong>S. No. </strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:25px; width:411px\">\r\n			<p><strong>NAME</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:25px; width:218px\">\r\n			<p><strong>DESIGNATION</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:25px; width:63px\">\r\n			<p><strong>1.</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:25px; width:411px\">\r\n			